  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Mohd. Ahmad S/O Mohd. Ayub vs State Of U.P. Through Secretary Home on 16 October, 2019 Author: Anil Kumar Bench: Anil Kumar, Saurabh Lavania High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad, Lucknow Bench ?Court No. - 3 Case :- Misc. Bench No. - 8227 of 2008 Petitioner :- Mohd. Ahmad S/O Mohd. Ayub Respondent :- State Of U.P. Through Secretary Home Counsel for Petitioner :- Farooq Ayub",
    "facts": "Learned counsel for the petitioners submits that petitioners are doing the business of slaughtering of selling of buffalo's meat from the time of his ancestral in village Ratauli, Police-Station Safadarganj in District Barabanki, but all of sudden on 3.1.2008, the opposite party no.4 started hindrance and interference in peaceful working and business of the petitioner's with the help of some unsocial and powerful person of the area in an illegal and arbitrary manner without any jurisdiction and they tried to stop the aforesaid business of the petitioner and on which the petitioner immediately submitted a representation dated 8.1.2008 before the opposite party no.2/District Magistrate and opposite party no.3/ Superintendent of Police, Barabanki to take action in the matter.",
